Spec: SpecDD Structure View

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / Kotlin

Purpose:
  Provide IntelliJ Structure view entries for SpecDD `.sdd` files.

Structure:
  ./SpecDDStructureModel.kt: Text-level section extraction model.
  ./SpecDDStructureViewFactory.kt: IntelliJ structure view factory, model, and tree elements.

Owns:
  ./structure.sdd
  ./SpecDDStructureModel.sdd
  ./SpecDDStructureViewFactory.sdd
  ./SpecDDStructureModel.kt
  ./SpecDDStructureViewFactory.kt

Can modify:
  ./structure.sdd
  ./SpecDDStructureModel.sdd
  ./SpecDDStructureViewFactory.sdd
  ./SpecDDStructureModel.kt
  ./SpecDDStructureViewFactory.kt

Can read:
  /src/main/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/parser/*
  /src/main/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/SpecDDPsiFile.kt
  /src/test/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/structure/*

Must:
  Keep structure behavior independent from syntax highlighting and validation diagnostics.
  Use the shared `SpecDDLineClassifier` line classification boundary.
  List every known section header in file order.
  Preserve repeated `Scenario` and `Example` entries as separate structure nodes.
  Display section labels with inline values when present.
  Navigate section nodes to their section header offsets.
  Register through IntelliJ plugin metadata using `lang.psiStructureViewFactory`.
  Cover structure extraction and factory behavior with Kotest BehaviorSpec tests.

Must not:
  Replace the minimal PSI parser with a full grammar only for structure view support.
  Define syntax highlighting colors.
  Report validation diagnostics.
  Add user-facing settings.
